## WEEK 3 — Payments

### Day 11 — Payment gateway setup
```
Integrate Razorpay (or Stripe if targeting international customers — ask me which before
starting) into Laravel for one-time and recurring plan payments. Set up the SDK, API keys in
.env, and a Payment model/migration: subscription_id, amount, gateway_transaction_id, status,
paid_at.
```

### Day 12 — Checkout flow
```
Build a member-facing "Renew/Buy Plan" checkout page: plan summary, amount, and a Pay Now
button that opens the Razorpay checkout modal. On success, create a Payment record, update
the Subscription, and redirect to a styled success page. On failure, show a retry option.
```

### Day 13 — Payment history & invoices
```
Add a Payments list page (admin) showing all transactions with filters by date range and
status. Add a member-facing "My Payments" page. Generate a simple PDF invoice for each
successful payment (use the pdf skill/DomPDF) with gym branding, and a "Download Invoice"
button.
```

### Day 14 — Webhooks & reconciliation
```
Add a webhook endpoint to handle Razorpay/Stripe payment events (payment.captured,
payment.failed) so subscription status updates even if the user closes the browser before
redirect. Add signature verification for security.
```

### Day 15 — Revenue reporting
```
Add a Reports > Revenue page: total revenue by month (bar chart), revenue by plan type (pie
chart), and an exportable CSV of all transactions in a date range.
```

