## Phase 3 — Engagement (Weekly prompts, Weeks 7–10)

### Week 7 — Workout plans
```
Build a Workout Plan module: trainers create exercise-based plans (exercise name, sets, reps,
rest, video link) and assign them to members. Members see their assigned plan on a "My
Workouts" page and can check off completed exercises per day.
```

### Week 8 — Diet plans
```
Build a Diet Plan module: trainers create meal plans (meal name, time, food items, calories/
macros) and assign to members. Add a simple "My Diet Plan" page for members with daily meal
checklist.
```

### Week 9 — Push notifications
```
Integrate Firebase Cloud Messaging for web/mobile push notifications. Trigger pushes for:
class reminder 1 hour before, plan expiry, new workout/diet plan assigned, and admin
announcements.
```

### Week 10 — Progress tracking
```
Build a Progress Tracking module: members log weight, body measurements, and optionally
upload progress photos on a schedule (weekly/monthly). Show a progress chart (Chart.js) on
their profile and let trainers view client progress from the trainer dashboard.
```

