## Notes on using these prompts effectively

- **One prompt per day/session** — don't batch multiple days into one Claude Code run; review
  and test between each so bugs don't compound.
- **Paste existing files first** — for Days 1, 4, 6 especially, paste in your existing
  landing.blade.php components/CSS so the AI matches your established theme instead of
  guessing at a new one.
- **Adjust the payment gateway** (Day 11) to your actual target market — Razorpay/PayU for
  India, Stripe/PayPal for international.
- **Re-order for your priorities** — if payments matter more than class booking for your
  first paying customer, swap Week 3 and Week 4.
